# 11. Pagination

ALL tables must support pagination.

Backend response should contain:

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": [],
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 10,
    "totalItems": 100,
    "totalPages": 10
  }
}
```

Frontend pagination must include:

- Previous
- Next
- Page numbers
- Current page
- Total pages
- Page-size selector

