```

Use WebSocket/Socket.IO where appropriate.

---

# 64. Important Business Rules

Implement these strictly:

### Rule 1

Only one DEFAULT_ADMIN can exist.

### Rule 2

DEFAULT_ADMIN cannot be deleted.

### Rule 3

DEFAULT_ADMIN cannot be demoted.

### Rule 4

Customer registration always creates CUSTOMER.

### Rule 5

Customer cannot access admin routes.

### Rule 6

Staff cannot manage administrator accounts.

### Rule 7

Customer cannot edit order total.

### Rule 8

Customer cannot edit payment status.

### Rule 9

Order starts as PENDING.

### Rule 10

Only authorized staff/admin can confirm an order.

### Rule 11

Customer can cancel only before confirmation.

### Rule 12

QR payment requires payment proof.

### Rule 13

Voucher download becomes available after confirmation.

### Rule 14

Order price must be calculated on the backend.

### Rule 15

Every order modification by admin requires a reason.

---

